# AI assistant configuration
# Everything is local by default. Shared skills and agents are opted in one by
# one below, so personal setups never show up in `git status`.
# See "AI tooling" in AGENTS.md.
/CLAUDE.local.md
/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/
/.claude/agents/*
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/README.md
# Shared agents (`!/.claude/agents/<name>.md`) and skills
# (`!/.agents/skills/<name>/`) go below.

# General rule for files explicitly marked as local
*.local.*

# Generated release-test playgrounds 
/release_tests

